# P132 measures every blended square against the plain one a second after it
# appears and logs its verdict; nothing is pressed. A blend mode must not change
# any size.
#
# The screenshot shows the colours. Each cell is a yellow-to-blue gradient with a
# pink square (230, 51, 128) over its right part; the square's right and bottom
# edges stick out onto the window background. Where the square covers the bluish
# part of the gradient, about (76, 107, 185):
#   normal           the plain pink square (the control)
#   multiply         dark purple, about (68, 21, 92); never lighter than either
#   screen           light pink-violet, about (237, 137, 220)
#   overlay          purple, about (137, 43, 185)
#   darken           dull violet, about (76, 51, 128)
#   lighten          pink-violet, about (230, 107, 185)
#   colorDodge       very light, towards white
#   colorBurn        dark, towards black and blue
#   softLight        the gradient slightly tinted pink
#   hardLight        a mid pink-purple, closer to the square than overlay
#   difference       brick red, about (154, 56, 57)
#   exclusion        greyish mauve, about (169, 116, 128)
#   hue              the gradient's lightness with a pink hue
#   saturation       the gradient's hue, as saturated as the square
#   color            pink with the gradient's lightness
#   luminosity       the gradient's hue with the square's lightness
#   sourceAtop       the plain square, as normal: everything behind it is opaque,
#                    the window background included, so it is drawn everywhere
#   destinationOver  no square at all: the gradient and the opaque window
#                    background both stay on top of it
#   destinationOut   a hole where the square is -- gradient and window background
#                    erased (white on macOS, 2026-11-25); the square is not drawn
#   plusDarker       near black, about (50, 0, 57)
#   plusLighter      light pink-magenta, about (255, 158, 255)
#
# expect: log-contains P132 PASS
#
# P132 在出現一秒後把每個混合後的方塊與一般方塊比較尺寸並記下結果，不按任何東西。混合模式不可改變任何尺寸。
# 截圖顯示顏色：每格是黃到藍的漸層，其右半部上方有一個粉紅方塊(230, 51, 128),方塊的右緣與下緣超出漸層，落在
# 視窗背景上。方塊覆蓋漸層偏藍處(約 (76, 107, 185))時：normal 為原樣的粉紅方塊(對照組);multiply 深紫約
# (68, 21, 92);screen 淡粉紫約 (237, 137, 220);overlay 紫約 (137, 43, 185);darken 暗紫約 (76, 51, 128);
# lighten 粉紫約 (230, 107, 185);colorDodge 很亮、趨近白;colorBurn 暗、趨近黑與藍;softLight 漸層略帶粉紅;
# hardLight 中等粉紫，比 overlay 更接近方塊;difference 磚紅約 (154, 56, 57);exclusion 灰紫約 (169, 116, 128);
# hue 漸層的亮度配粉紅色相;saturation 漸層的色相配方塊的飽和度;color 粉紅配漸層的亮度;luminosity 漸層的
# 色相配方塊的亮度;sourceAtop 與 normal 相同(後方包括視窗背景都不透明，所以處處畫出);destinationOver 完全看不到方塊
# (漸層與不透明的視窗背景都在它上面);destinationOut 方塊處挖出一個洞(macOS 上為白色，2026-11-25),方塊本身不畫;plusDarker 近黑約 (50, 0, 57);plusLighter
# 淡粉洋紅約 (255, 158, 255)。
#
# WinUI: destinationOut computes the erased gradient but draws it over the untouched one, so that cell shows the gradient with no square (WinUIBackend+VisualEffects.swift, BlendMode.direct2D). / WinUI:destinationOut 算出擦除後的漸層，卻畫在未改動的漸層上，因此該格只見漸層、不見方塊。
